WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:54.280 --> 00:00:57.680
AN IOP HIDES HIMSELF TO CRY

00:01:02.800 --> 00:01:06.920
I've taken some big hits,
but I've blacked out before.

00:01:08.240 --> 00:01:10.280
Come on! Get up!

00:01:10.360 --> 00:01:14.440
Catch your breath,
but don't keep Vlady waiting!

00:01:15.200 --> 00:01:17.640
We've seen worse than that guy.

00:01:17.720 --> 00:01:20.640
You've beaten tougher foes than him.

00:01:21.720 --> 00:01:24.720
I'm doing what I can, Rubi.

00:01:24.800 --> 00:01:26.520
That's not enough.

00:01:27.320 --> 00:01:31.560
Get back on your feet, please,
and show him who's boss.

00:01:32.640 --> 00:01:35.360
&lt;i&gt;He knows how to motivate me.&lt;/i&gt;

00:01:35.960 --> 00:01:40.960
I can hear what you think.
Had you forgotten we're connected?

00:01:41.040 --> 00:01:43.520
I can't talk to myself anymore!

00:01:43.600 --> 00:01:46.280
Stop your Iopishness and get up.

00:01:50.320 --> 00:01:53.080
There we go. Don't be a drama queen.

00:01:56.200 --> 00:01:59.720
Excellent, Daddy's up!

00:02:00.240 --> 00:02:02.760
Now we can get back to playing!

00:02:03.720 --> 00:02:07.600
Daddy's tired.
It's time for you to go beddy-byes!

00:02:16.400 --> 00:02:20.880
No, I don't believe it!
But I know how to do that, too!

00:02:26.440 --> 00:02:27.400
Rubi?

00:02:28.280 --> 00:02:30.880
Sorry, friend, I'm at my max here.

00:02:30.960 --> 00:02:33.040
His is bigger. Good luck.

00:02:36.000 --> 00:02:37.760
Okay, we'll make do.

00:02:46.640 --> 00:02:49.240
First one to die loses!

00:02:50.160 --> 00:02:52.640
For Eva and the children!

00:03:37.880 --> 00:03:39.120
The Iop level.

00:03:43.320 --> 00:03:45.920
He looks more like a skeleton.

00:03:46.920 --> 00:03:48.440
He looks like Ruel.

00:03:48.520 --> 00:03:52.000
Except with me,
the fire is in my underwear.

00:03:57.800 --> 00:03:58.760
Papa?

00:04:02.520 --> 00:04:03.400
Papa!

00:04:09.720 --> 00:04:11.000
It's Goultard.

00:04:12.240 --> 00:04:15.920
No mistake, that's ol' Goultard.
Look closely.

00:04:19.600 --> 00:04:25.320
Since Adamai had the Eliatrope Dofus,
I was wondering about him...

00:04:40.320 --> 00:04:44.240
We'll worry later.
We've got a bigger problem.

00:04:44.800 --> 00:04:46.840
Can we get by safely?

00:04:48.600 --> 00:04:53.000
They made him regress to his avatar form.

00:04:53.080 --> 00:04:56.400
The Iop is explaining something to us now?

00:04:57.480 --> 00:04:59.360
What's wrong with you?

00:04:59.440 --> 00:05:03.640
You're a princess, but he's a god.
Have some respect.

00:05:23.960 --> 00:05:26.880
You're venturing further and further.

00:05:38.680 --> 00:05:43.200
I wonder who they were...
It looks like they were a family.

00:05:44.200 --> 00:05:46.600
Is that what we are? A family?

00:05:50.160 --> 00:05:53.680
What's that? Are those tears on your face?

00:05:57.360 --> 00:05:59.720
I felt a drop. It's going to rain.

00:06:01.040 --> 00:06:03.280
Anyway, Iops don't cry.

00:06:03.360 --> 00:06:09.440
And if ever it had to happen,
an Iop would cry in private.

00:06:10.320 --> 00:06:11.800
Okay, Master.

00:06:11.880 --> 00:06:16.960
As for your first question,
no, we'll never be a family.

00:06:18.000 --> 00:06:20.560
I've never told you why I'm here.

00:06:21.480 --> 00:06:24.560
This desert wasn't one, not so long ago.

00:06:26.080 --> 00:06:29.320
It was a city, an amazingly beautiful one.

00:06:32.720 --> 00:06:36.240
But one day, a monster arrived,
horrible...

00:06:36.800 --> 00:06:41.440
...violent, indestructible,
ravaged by despair and hatred.

00:06:42.320 --> 00:06:44.400
The city was destroyed.

00:06:47.160 --> 00:06:49.040
The entire city... dead.

00:06:50.600 --> 00:06:55.640
His thirst for blood slaked,
he returned to sanity.

00:06:58.440 --> 00:07:00.200
I am not a nice Iop.

00:07:00.800 --> 00:07:05.600
My father transferred a curse to me.
I'm here to remind myself.

00:07:07.160 --> 00:07:08.760
I don't understand.

00:07:10.880 --> 00:07:12.760
The monster, the monster...

00:07:13.440 --> 00:07:14.520
...it was me.

00:07:20.440 --> 00:07:23.560
We can forget getting by safely, then?

00:07:23.640 --> 00:07:26.280
No. You will get by safely.

00:07:26.360 --> 00:07:30.520
No, Dally, we'll take him all together.

00:07:30.600 --> 00:07:34.160
Listen to my father, Yugo,
He's the boss here!

00:07:34.240 --> 00:07:37.480
-You're going with them.
-In your dreams!

00:07:37.560 --> 00:07:40.440
Yugo's the boss. We listen to him.

00:07:41.040 --> 00:07:43.000
Ow! What are you doing?

00:07:43.600 --> 00:07:46.920
You were trying to knock me out.

00:07:47.000 --> 00:07:50.240
I'm too old now. You're not strong enough.

00:07:53.440 --> 00:07:57.360
This is a family matter.
I must handle it now.

00:07:57.440 --> 00:07:59.600
I'll catch up with you.

00:07:59.680 --> 00:08:02.880
Trust me. I've got to do this on my own!

00:08:04.000 --> 00:08:07.800
Elely, it's like the time
I let you fight that Pandawa.

00:08:07.880 --> 00:08:10.160
I trusted you. It's your turn now.

00:08:14.120 --> 00:08:17.480
Hurry. We have to rescue Mama and Flopin!

00:08:19.120 --> 00:08:21.240
Let's do as the boss said.

00:08:21.320 --> 00:08:24.360
Once he's got it, that's it!

00:08:25.280 --> 00:08:28.760
-How do we do this?
-We take him by surprise.

00:08:31.280 --> 00:08:34.280
Be careful. We'll go ahead.

00:08:36.800 --> 00:08:39.080
A new way of saying goodbye?

00:08:40.600 --> 00:08:43.760
You crazy youngsters, watch your backside.

00:08:50.600 --> 00:08:52.720
I'm the one who does that.

00:08:53.960 --> 00:08:57.560
And don't forget, Papa.
An Iop must know how to use his head!

00:09:09.400 --> 00:09:11.320
Dream on, little ones...

00:09:17.800 --> 00:09:19.000
Here it comes!

00:09:35.880 --> 00:09:37.160
Good luck, Papa!

00:09:41.160 --> 00:09:43.720
That thing has side effects.

00:09:47.120 --> 00:09:48.600
How disrespectful!

00:09:48.680 --> 00:09:51.240
Not at all! I know you very well.

00:09:51.320 --> 00:09:55.040
Dark Vlad!
Searching for battles worthy of him.

00:09:55.120 --> 00:09:57.520
You think you're good enough?

00:10:12.840 --> 00:10:16.760
You didn't answer!
Do you think you're good enough?

00:10:22.880 --> 00:10:25.120
Does that answer your question?

00:10:26.000 --> 00:10:29.600
You don't seem to remember me!
Let me refresh your memory.

00:10:32.080 --> 00:10:33.920
You've got this!

00:10:34.000 --> 00:10:36.480
I am Sir Percedal of Sadlygrove!

00:10:43.600 --> 00:10:45.160
Nice to meet you.

00:10:45.760 --> 00:10:47.160
The true Iop god!

00:10:56.760 --> 00:11:00.480
So, now the real question is,
are you good enough?

00:11:01.000 --> 00:11:04.440
Oh, wow, I've never been hit
like that before,

00:11:04.520 --> 00:11:07.440
No way! You cracked my skull!

00:11:09.320 --> 00:11:12.160
You just walk up, your arms like that

00:11:12.240 --> 00:11:17.240
and you give me a series of head-butts.
It's just wonderful!

00:11:17.800 --> 00:11:19.840
No spectators, real shame.

00:11:19.920 --> 00:11:24.480
I didn't understand your gods thing,
but who cares?

00:11:25.200 --> 00:11:29.680
Because little Goultard,
he feels something for you.

00:11:31.040 --> 00:11:35.040
That's it,
a mix of admiration and animosity.

00:11:35.120 --> 00:11:38.160
And just a smidgen of hatred, too.

00:11:38.640 --> 00:11:42.920
You were a daddy who never
spent much time with Goultard.

00:11:43.520 --> 00:11:50.000
Let's just beat each other like Iopheads
before bringing Goultard back.

00:11:50.560 --> 00:11:54.320
Yeah, definitely!
That's what I wanted to hear.

00:11:54.400 --> 00:11:58.000
Big speeches aren't our thing
in this family.

00:11:59.080 --> 00:12:00.400
Not really, no.

00:12:00.480 --> 00:12:04.880
Stay focused. The temperature is rising,
that's not good.

00:12:08.840 --> 00:12:12.680
Get a grip,
or this is going to be over swiftly.

00:12:14.680 --> 00:12:17.640
You shouldn't rush the preliminaries.

00:13:21.400 --> 00:13:22.360
That's Papa.

00:13:24.360 --> 00:13:27.320
A racket like that means he's fighting.

00:13:27.800 --> 00:13:31.360
Have faith. Dally always comes out on top.

00:13:32.080 --> 00:13:35.360
But he lost the powers of the Iop god.

00:13:35.440 --> 00:13:39.320
He's going to win!
We must trust each other.

00:13:39.400 --> 00:13:41.760
That's what he asked us to do.

00:13:42.520 --> 00:13:44.960
I... Okay!

00:14:06.560 --> 00:14:08.120
You're slipping.

00:14:43.320 --> 00:14:45.040
He... He hits hard...

00:14:45.920 --> 00:14:49.440
-Quit complaining.
-You're not getting hit!

00:14:49.520 --> 00:14:51.440
Ogrest was much worse.

00:14:52.280 --> 00:14:55.320
But I was in shape against Ogrest.

00:14:55.400 --> 00:14:59.200
No, you had heart.
Now you're not even an Iop.

00:14:59.280 --> 00:15:01.760
What are you talking about?

00:15:01.840 --> 00:15:04.480
You're no longer the Iop you were.

00:15:04.560 --> 00:15:07.480
You were always up to the challenge.

00:15:07.560 --> 00:15:12.040
Look at the madman over there.
He's having a real blast.

00:15:18.840 --> 00:15:23.840
You're too scared of never seeing
your family again.

00:15:24.320 --> 00:15:27.520
As long as that doesn't change,
it's over.

00:15:45.280 --> 00:15:49.000
I've taken big hits,
but I've never blacked out.

00:15:49.760 --> 00:15:51.560
You're wrong, Ruby.

00:15:53.280 --> 00:15:54.160
How's that?

00:15:54.880 --> 00:15:58.480
My family isn't making me weaker,
but stronger.

00:16:03.520 --> 00:16:07.000
I'll keep going until I find them.

00:16:15.640 --> 00:16:16.880
If you say so...

00:16:18.360 --> 00:16:19.960
And I'll prove it!

00:17:22.760 --> 00:17:24.400
Come on, Dally!

00:19:21.400 --> 00:19:23.600
It's all right. Don't worry.

00:19:28.800 --> 00:19:31.720
Incredible.
We might have found a way out of here.

00:19:53.440 --> 00:19:56.400
That wasn't really a great idea.

00:19:56.480 --> 00:19:58.400
Confronting your dark side?

00:19:59.080 --> 00:20:01.640
No, breaking the last column.

00:20:05.400 --> 00:20:06.600
It's not good!

00:20:11.120 --> 00:20:13.240
I'm glad you're here.

00:20:13.320 --> 00:20:14.600
Me too, son.

00:20:57.360 --> 00:21:01.320
That idiot Dark Vlad's level
just collapsed.

00:21:01.960 --> 00:21:07.040
The tower is balanced on my spirit.
It can't collapse completely.

00:21:08.080 --> 00:21:10.200
I hope little Elely is all right.

00:21:10.880 --> 00:21:15.160
It would be terrible to lose
my future Iop goddess.

